In the meantime, navigating both an eviction and a custody case simultaneously can be incredibly stressful, especially when financial details overlap between the two. To help you organize your thoughts before you speak with your attorney, Sarah Chen, here is a structured list of questions you can ask her to prepare for the upcoming status conference and anticipate what the judge or opposing counsel might focus on:

